    {
      "id": 25789,
      "name": "pulpcitizen",
      "username": "pulpcitizen",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/85e7bf/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-09-15T18:23:22.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Sorry for the threadomancy, but my issue is related.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I want to pick up a few items (promo decks, the new box and rule book, the HP cards), yet I do not want to have to sign up to Google Checkout to do so, and have been happy with Paypal for years.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Are there any plans to move to Paypal payments or credit/debit cards at checkout and avoid the Google Checkout requirement? If not, is there anyway I can sort out an order for these items with Paypal (I ask as they are beyond the simple issue re: replacementts above)?</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:59:41.404Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
