      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Sorry for the threadomancy, but my issue is related.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I want to pick up a few items (promo decks, the new box and rule book, the HP cards), yet I do not want to have to sign up to Google Checkout to do so, and have been happy with Paypal for years.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Are there any plans to move to Paypal payments or credit/debit cards at checkout and avoid the Google Checkout requirement? If not, is there anyway I can sort out an order for these items with Paypal (I ask as they are beyond the simple issue re: replacementts above)?</p>",
