    {
      "id": 25791,
      "name": "Paul",
      "username": "Paul",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-09-17T18:13:06.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The merchant interface (and the merchant billing charges) for Google Checkout / Google Wallet are much better for our purposes than PayPal, so we will stay on Google for the forseeable future. Unfortunately, our inventory tracking etc all runs through Google, so it is a lot of extra work to end-run around the system and sell things via PayPal, and now that we have international order support via Google, PayPal transactions are not something that we are going to support going forward.</p>",
